    "_doc": "Che do GIAI THICH - khach hoi kien thuc chu khong phai nho chon may. Template cung, khong LLM -> khong the bia. Bang m2->HP o day la kien thuc nganh pho thong dung lam HUONG DAN (khong phai khang dinh ve san pham cu the nen khong dung cham voi viec da bo bang tra khoi loc cung).",
